=== relationDepthSharedCheckOrder.ts ===
// Relating I0 to J0 fresh nests a comparison 100 levels deep, where it is
// cut short and so succeeds. In program order Mid has already found that
// I60 is not related to J60. Whether I0 is related to J0 must not depend
// on which comes first. Conditional types relate without reporting errors,
// which would compute the comparison again.

